The PluginManager class is sealed, so I cannot subclass it to override methods. I will test the ProcessAlternative method indirectly by invoking LoadAssemblies and setting up the plugins list to trigger the error logging. I will mock the dependencies and create LocalPlugin test doubles with the necessary properties and behavior.

I will submit a new test file that mocks ILogger and uses reflection to set the private _plugins field to control the plugins list. Then I will call LoadAssemblies to trigger ProcessAlternative and verify the error logs.

